Customer Service

A Spring Boot REST API for managing customer information using Spring Data JPA and MySQL.

📌 Project Overview

This project is a Maven-based Spring Boot application with a simple layered structure:

Controller → Handles HTTP requests

Service → Contains business logic

Repository → Communicates with the database

Model → Represents the Customer entity

Exception → Handles application errors

🛠️ Technologies Used

Java 17

Spring Boot

Spring Web

Spring Data JPA

MySQL

Maven

Eclipse / Spring Tool Suite

Git & GitHub

